flowchart TB
  event[Runtime Event]
  activity[Activity Logger]
  correlate[Correlation Model]
  validate[Validation Gate]
  diagnose[Failure Diagnosis]
  recovery[Recovery Candidate]
  policy[Policy Review]
  operator[Operator Approval]
  apply[Controlled Recovery]
  evidence[Evidence Update]

  event --> activity
  activity --> correlate
  correlate --> validate
  validate --> diagnose
  diagnose --> recovery
  recovery --> policy
  policy --> operator
  operator --> apply
  apply --> evidence
  evidence --> activity

  policy -. blocks unsafe recovery .-> diagnose
  operator -. rejects or defers .-> evidence
